Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(mcp): camcraft-mcp skill lists set_raw_stock_only;
 PROCESS_VERSION 19

The skill's stock section gains the set_raw_stock_only row (one undo
step through SetStockSourceOnly; default off; the mark is ignored when
the model or its geometry no longer matches; an operation naming the
model puts it back in the verdict; the post is refused when nothing is
left to judge).

Fixes #1106

